  "description": "Roslyn analyzer and code fixes that validate Durable Task Framework orchestration code for determinism constraints. Ensures orchestrator functions follow replay-safe patterns required for Durable Functions and Azure Functions. Detects non-deterministic operations including DateTime.Now, Guid.NewGuid(), Random, I/O operations, environment variables, static state, threading APIs, and more. Includes automatic code fixes for common violations.",
